#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:31
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid "It is a dialog box for managing diagnostic messages at runtime."
msgid ""
"&kdebugdialog; is a dialog box for managing diagnostic messages at runtime. "
"It features a simple and a full mode."
msgstr "នេះ​គឺ​ជា​ប្រអប់​សម្រាប់​គ្រាប់​សារ​វិនិច្ឆ័យ​នៅ​ពេល​វេលា​រត់ ។"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:33
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In order to be able to make changes <guilabel>Disable all debug output</"
"guilabel> has to be unchecked."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:38
#, no-c-format
msgid "Simple mode"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:40
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "If you simply start <command>kdebugdialog</command>, you will see a list "
#| "of <quote>areas</quote>, that can be disabled or enabled. A "
#| "<function>kdDebug(area)</function> call in the code will show something "
#| "in the debug output only if the area is enabled."
msgid ""
"If you simply start <command>kdebugdialog</command>, you will see a list of "
"<quote>areas</quote>, that can be disabled or enabled. A "
"<function>kDebug(area)</function> call in the code will show something in "
"the debug output only if the area is enabled."
msgstr ""
"បើ​អ្នក​ចាប់ផ្ដើម​ជា​ធម្មតា <command>kdebugdialog</command> អ្នក​នឹង​ឃើញ​បញ្ជី​នៃ "
"<quote>តំបន់</quote> ដែល​អាច​ត្រូវ​បាន​បិទ ឬ​បើក ។ <function>kdDebug(area)</function> "
"ហៅ​ក្នុង​កូដ​នឹង​បង្ហាញ​អ្វី​នៅ​ក្នុង​ទិន្នន័យ​បំបាត់​កំហុស​បើ​តំបន់​ត្រូវ​បាន​បើក ។"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:45
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "Note that kdWarning, kdError and kdFatal always appear, they are NOT "
#| "controlled by this setting."
msgid ""
"Note that kWarning, kError and kFatal always appear, they are <emphasis>NOT</"
"emphasis> controlled by this setting."
msgstr ""
"ចំណាំ​ថា kdWarning kdError និង kdFatal លេខឡើង​ជានិច្ច ពួក​វា​មិន​ត្រូវ​បាន​គ្រប់គ្រង​ដោយ​ការ​កំណត់​នេះ​"
"ទេ ។"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:48
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Enter a matching string into the <guilabel>Search</guilabel> box at the top "
"of the list, this allows you to filter the areas which are displayed in the "
"list view. Use the buttons below the list to select or deselect all items in "
"the view (the other areas are not effected) or change the debug output for a "
"single item using the check box in front of it."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:60
#, no-c-format
msgid "Full mode"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:62
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you start <command>kdebugdialog</command> <option>--fullmode</option>, "
"then for every severity level you can define separately what should be done "
"with the diagnostic messages of that level, and the same for each debug area."
msgstr ""
"បើ​អ្នក​ចាប់ផ្ដើម <command>kdebugdialog</command> <option>--fullmode</option> "
"បន្ទាប់​សម្រាប់​កម្រិត​ធ្ងន់​បំផុត​ដែល​អ្នក​អាច​កំណត់​ដាច់​ដោយ​ឡែក​អ្វី​ដែល​គួរ​ធ្វើ​រួច​ជាមួយ​សារ​វិនិច្ឆ័យ​របស់​កម្រិត និង​"
"ដូចគ្នា​សម្រាប់​តំបន់​បំបាត់​កំហុស​នីមួយៗ ។"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:67
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "In full mode, first you should select the debug area you are interested "
#| "in from the drop down list at the top."
msgid ""
"In full mode, first you should select the debug area you are interested in "
"from the list at the left of the dialog using the search box at the top of "
"the list."
msgstr "ក្នុង​របៀប​ពេញ ដំបូង​អ្នក​គួរ​ជ្រើស​តំបន់​បំបាត់​កំហុស​ដែល​អ្នក​ចាប់​អារម្មណ៍​ពី​បញ្ជី​ធ្លាក់​ចុះ​នៅ​កំពូល ។"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:71
#, no-c-format
msgid "You may independently set the output for various types of messages:"
msgstr "អ្នក​អាច​កំណត់​ដាច់​ដោយ​ឡែក​នូវ​ទិន្នផល​សម្រាប់​ប្រភេទ​ផ្សេងៗ​នៃ​សារ ៖"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:75
#, no-c-format
msgid "Information"
msgstr "ព័ត៌មាន"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:76
#, no-c-format
msgid "Warning"
msgstr "ព្រមាន"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:77
#, no-c-format
msgid "Error"
msgstr "កំហុស"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:78
#, no-c-format
msgid "Fatal Error"
msgstr "កំហុស​ធ្ងន់​ធ្ងរ"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:81
#, no-c-format
msgid "For each of these types, you can set the following:"
msgstr "សម្រាប់​ប្រភេទ​ទាំងនេះ អ្នក​អាច​កំណត់​ដូច​ខាងក្រោម ៖"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:85
#, no-c-format
msgid "Output to:"
msgstr "បញ្ចេញ​លទ្ធផល​ទៅ ៖"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:87
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In this Combobox, you can choose where the messages should be output. The "
"choices are: <quote>File</quote>, <quote>Message Box</quote>, <quote>Shell</"
"quote> (meaning stderr) and <quote>Syslog</quote>. Please do not direct "
"fatal messages to syslog unless you are the system administrator yourself. "
"The default is <quote>Shell</quote>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:97
#, no-c-format
msgid "Filename:"
msgstr "ឈ្មោះ​ឯកសារ ៖"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:98
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This is only enabled when you have chosen <quote>File</quote> as the output "
"and provides the name of that file (which is interpreted as relative to the "
"current folder). The default is <filename>kdebug.dbg</filename>."
msgstr ""
"នេះ​ត្រូវ​បាន​បើក​តែ​នៅ​ពេល​អ្នក​បាន​ជ្រើស <quote>ឯកសារ</quote> ជា​ទិន្នផល និង​ផ្ដល់​ឈ្មោះ​របស់​ឯកសារ​"
"នោះ (ដែល​បាន​បកប្រែ​ជាប់ទាក់ទង​ទៅ​និង​ថត​បច្ចុប្បន្ន) ។ លំនាំ​ដើម​គឺ <filename>kdebug.dbg</"
"filename> ។"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:106
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "Apart from this, you can also tick the checkbox <guilabel>Abort on fatal "
#| "errors</guilabel>. In this case, if a diagnostic message with the "
#| "severity level <computeroutput>KDEBUG_FATAL</computeroutput> is output, "
#| "the application aborts with a SIGABRT after outputting the message."
msgid ""
"Apart from this, you can also tick the check box <guilabel>Abort on fatal "
"errors</guilabel>. In this case, if a diagnostic message with the severity "
"level <computeroutput>KDEBUG_FATAL</computeroutput> is output, the "
"application aborts with a SIGABRT after outputting the message."
msgstr ""
"មួយ​ផ្នែក​ពី​នេះ អ្នក​អាច​ធីក​ប្រអប់​ធីក <guilabel>បោះបង់​ពេល​កំហុស​ធ្ងន់ធ្ងរ</guilabel> ។ ក្នុង​ករណី​នេះ "
"បើ​រូបភាព​វិនិច្ឆ័យ​ជាមួយ​កម្រិត​សុវត្ថិភាព <computeroutput>KDEBUG_FATAL</computeroutput> គឺ​"
"ទិន្នផល កម្មវិធី​បោះបង់​ជាមួយ SIGABRT បន្ទាប់​ពី​បញ្ចេញ​ទិន្នផល​សារ ។"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:116
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "When you close the dialog by pressing <guibutton>OK</guibutton>, your "
#| "entries apply immediately and are saved in <filename>kdebugrc</filename>. "
#| "When you press <guibutton>Cancel</guibutton>, your entries are discarded "
#| "and the old ones are restored."
msgid ""
"When you close the dialog by pressing <guibutton>OK</guibutton>, your "
"entries apply immediately and are saved in <filename>$<envar>KDEHOME</envar>/"
"share/config/kdebugrc</filename>. When you press <guibutton>Cancel</"
"guibutton>, your entries are discarded and the old ones are restored."
msgstr ""
"ពេល​អ្នក​បិទ​ប្រអប់​ដោយ​ចុច <guibutton>យល់ព្រម</guibutton> ធាតុ​របស់​អ្នក​អនុវត្ត​ភ្លាមៗ និង​ត្រូវ​បាន​"
"រក្សា​ទុក​ក្នុង <filename>kdebugrc</filename> ។ ពេល​អ្នក​ចុច <guibutton>បោះបង់</"
"guibutton> ធាតុ​របស់​អ្នក​ត្រូវ​បាន​បោះបង់ និង​ធាតុ​ចាស់​ត្រូវ​បាន​ស្ដារ ។"

